      "text": "- Order Gateway: enable external internet communication with\nexchange via the order service\n- Gateway manage outbound requests. (AWT NAT gateway). Auto-\nscaling criterion eg: 50% CPU usage hit across fleet for autoscale. \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Order Gateway: enable external internet communication with exchange via the order service\n- Gateway manage outbound requests. (AWT NAT gateway). Auto-scaling criterion eg: 50% CPU usage hit across fleet for autoscale. \n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
