      "updated": 1786908695887,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) How can the system scale up live price updates?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) How can the system scale up live price updates?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "X16eZVTNy3pFzRHZ9JSIV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 890.2551676097632,
      "y": 1398.2458916238206,
      "width": 797.7058404391572,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bwA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1203182842,
      "version": 930,
      "versionNonce": 500431846,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786908687282,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Leverage REDIS pub/sub to publish/subscribe to price update.\n1) Subscribe via symbol service server. Server track Symbol -> Set<userId>\nmapping\n2) Symbol service server manage subscriptions to Redis pub/sub\n3) When symbol change price, price update processed by symbol price processor,\nwhich publish price update to Redis => Fan-out and send price update to all\nusers\n4) If unsubscribe to symbols or disconnect (detect via some heartbeat\nmechanism). symbol service server go through each symbol and remove them from\nSet<userId>",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Leverage REDIS pub/sub to publish/subscribe to price update.\n1) Subscribe via symbol service server. Server track Symbol -> Set<userId> mapping\n2) Symbol service server manage subscriptions to Redis pub/sub\n3) When symbol change price, price update processed by symbol price processor, which publish price update to Redis => Fan-out and send price update to all users\n4) If unsubscribe to symbols or disconnect (detect via some heartbeat mechanism). symbol service server go through each symbol and remove them from Set<userId>",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
