      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Key-Value data store to map externalOrderId to (orderId, userId). Eg: RocksDB\n- Key-value store would populate by order server after order is submitted to exchange synchronously\n- Process quick: shard via userId -> lookupOrder via orderId for Order's details",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Key-Value data store to map externalOrderId to (orderId, userId). Eg: RocksDB\n- Key-value store would populate by order server after order is submitted to exchange synchronously\n- Process quick: shard via userId -> lookupOrder via orderId for Order's details",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
